From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] main: keep semantic key surface focusable

The fullscreen shell's overlay is the focus owner for GTK4 keyboard input.
Mark it focusable so F1-F8 capture remains active after view switches.

--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -331,4 +331,5 @@
         zoom_controller.connect("key-pressed", _capture_zoom_key)
         shell_instance._main_window.add_controller(zoom_controller)
         shell_instance._sugar_zoom_controller = zoom_controller
+        shell_instance._overlay.set_focusable(True)
         shell_instance._main_window.set_focus(shell_instance._overlay)
